<title>AUSTRIA: Austrian markets closed on Thursday.</title>
<headline>Austrian markets closed on Thursday.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austrian financial markets will be closed on Thursday for the Corpus Christi holiday. Markets will re-open on Friday. -- Vienna newsroom, +431 53112 274</p>
